+# Transport compression policy
+
+No formal decision on the transport compression codec is recorded for this project. The only statement on record is a bare "zstd" from a project session, with no task or rationale attached. It was seen in the project's own transcripts and has not been confirmed as a decision, so it is treated as an unverified indication and not as a settled choice. Until a decision is recorded, this project has no established transport compression codec.
